# Leading slash on every build artifact below: unanchored, these match at any
# depth. `coverage*` silently swallowed internal/cmd/coverage_test.go, so a
# clone of the committed tree failed to build; `a` would do the same to any
# future file or package directory named `a`.
/.coverdata
/coverage*
/dist/
logs
out/
tags
/a
